# GK630K: silence the firmware key-echo consumer usages (0x05xx press / 0x06xx
# release). They map to KEY_UNKNOWN and wedge the input layer forever
# (firmware never sends value 0, so the key never releases and blocks
# Super-key combos like the GNOME overview trigger).
